    <h1>Sustainability of AI in Retail &amp; E-Commerce: TikTok Shop Seller in Malaysia</h1>
    <p>Examining whether AI adoption, the factors that influence it, and customer satisfaction and trust actually translate into environmental sustainability for Malaysian TikTok Shop sellers.</p>
  </div>
